<body>
    <h1>Product Info - Hierarchy Changes</h1>
    <div class=3D"Section1">
        <p local-id=3D"f5da98cb78bf"><strong>PowerBI "Product Mapping" aka =
(Source of Truth) </strong>--&gt; <a class=3D"external-link" href=3D"https:=
//app.powerbi.com/Redirect?action=3DOpenReport&amp;appId=3Df4530bb5-b525-47=
17-b846-d1774eade730&amp;reportObjectId=3Da64d3696-aa16-43c8-91d5-f72ef195f=
e3d&amp;ctid=3Dca81e23b-3509-45ee-a998-3e346acf274d&amp;reportPage=3D1f6b4f=
c27f8a4aee11b7&amp;pbi_source=3DappShareLink&amp;portalSessionId=3D11186844=
-c86d-4503-91b7-baee2e971981" rel=3D"nofollow">Product Mapping</a></p>
<p local-id=3D"af8882307faa"></p>
<p local-id=3D"388ad02f039c"><strong>Internal Naming and Mapping of Fortra =
Developed Products</strong></p>
<p local-id=3D"a162942e4593"></p>
<p local-id=3D"7d4ebc5c636c"><strong>Definitions (drafting):</strong>&nbsp;=
</p>
<p local-id=3D"17aadc94ff6b">Unit&nbsp;</p>
<p local-id=3D"95cd63d27f15">Solution Group&nbsp;</p>
<p local-id=3D"1a2e853aca7d">Business Unit&nbsp;</p>
<p local-id=3D"91ec8a5dc58a">Brand / Product Line&nbsp;</p>
<p local-id=3D"2ab0a866712c">Product =E2=80=93 A solution that is developed=
 by our R&amp;D teams.&nbsp;</p>
<p local-id=3D"fd96d127ca05"><strong>Summary:</strong>&nbsp;</p>
<p local-id=3D"51559c937454">Fortra=E2=80=99s corporate level mapping of pr=
oducts by Unit, Solution Group, and Product Line (Business Unit). This repo=
rt will live on the Fortra Hub and will be our "Source of Truth" for intern=
al naming and mapping. A change management process will be created and adop=
ted for future changes to this =E2=80=9CSource of Truth.=E2=80=9D&nbsp;&nbs=
p;</p>
<ul local-id=3D"7be821d07b7d">
<li local-id=3D"cd4538a057ff">
<p local-id=3D"51d73d71ae46">This should NOT initially change any integral =
tools (CRM/ADP/Etc) today =E2=80=93 just a reference point.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>=
</li>
</ul>
<ul local-id=3D"51904e17048d">
<li local-id=3D"de511b007066">
<p local-id=3D"9dec753a6cf7">Over the next few months, the Innovation Cente=
r will reach out to each department and analyze what tools can or should be=
 changed while working closely with each department to confirm a change man=
agement process is in place. Please reach out to ensure any changes you mak=
e will not affect other departments or reporting before making a change.&nb=
sp;&nbsp;</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"d4c29a1b7121"><strong>The Problem:&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;</p>
<p local-id=3D"a41f300f9594">It is important that we all speak the same lan=
guage internally across Fortra.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p>
<ul local-id=3D"b3ac9351f404">
<li local-id=3D"9a0278f18b67">
<p local-id=3D"613613952ecc">Historically we have not had good change manag=
ement process, communication, or collaboration at all department levels at =
=E2=80=9CUnit/Solution Group/Business Unit=E2=80=9D as each department uses=
 a different name for one Brand or Solution Group.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p></li>
</ul>
<ul local-id=3D"34cb974e20a9">
<li local-id=3D"ed96ed287a0e">
<p local-id=3D"2bf96d41cb75">Changes happen in one location but not others.=
&nbsp;</p></li>
</ul>
<ul local-id=3D"9b0e788b9f92">
<li local-id=3D"8035a3c3c78f">
<p local-id=3D"a1b248b4ace0">Teams not knowing the =E2=80=9Cright=E2=80=9D =
terminology to use.&nbsp;</p></li>
</ul>
<ul local-id=3D"e7971467beda">
<li local-id=3D"61b26bf98db0">
<p local-id=3D"33d5a81df882">Loss of Identity:&nbsp;&nbsp;</p></li>
</ul>
<ul local-id=3D"e7448eb2197a">
<li local-id=3D"0ee15376cc0d">
<p local-id=3D"26b45ee449aa">New employees may not understand where they fi=
t when listening to an All-Company meeting where abbreviations or Solution =
Group names are being used.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p></li>
</ul>
<ul local-id=3D"a93a6bfd1fa5">
<li local-id=3D"e7017e444213">
<p local-id=3D"3daff6f51276">Extra work as multiple systems are out of sync=
 and require manual "work arounds" to map correctly.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"b9b6897ab6bd"><strong>The Solution:</strong>&nbsp;</p>
<ul local-id=3D"32478d026783">
<li local-id=3D"f66fd5ef8b20">
<p local-id=3D"8df0b08f7695">One central location on SharePoint Fortra Hub =
for the =E2=80=9CSource of Truth=E2=80=9D of our internal naming convention=
s and mapping of Unit/Solution Group/Business Unit. This process will be ow=
ned by the Innovation Center with review and approval of changes through OT=
M.&nbsp;</p></li>
</ul>
<ul local-id=3D"6f9119208c12">
<li local-id=3D"144edb4250b1">
<p local-id=3D"e0849b505d0e">This =E2=80=9CSource of Truth=E2=80=9D will be=
 a reference point for teams to know the latest internal naming conventions=
.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p></li>
</ul>
<ul local-id=3D"67ed60aced0f">
<li local-id=3D"76eef96ba8d6">
<p local-id=3D"7ca99113fd4f">This will NOT initially change any integral to=
ols =E2=80=93 just a reference point for today.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p></li>
</ul>
<ul local-id=3D"1400950a0d57">
<li local-id=3D"0a97c0055813">
<p local-id=3D"74da97c4a72c">There will be an intake form on this page for =
suggested changes in the future to be reviewed and approved by OTM.&nbsp;</=
p></li>
</ul>
<ul local-id=3D"3ecb21963664">
<li local-id=3D"00e441b55b08">
<p local-id=3D"dcd41d8f019e">If a change is requested of this =E2=80=9CSour=
ce of Truth=E2=80=9D in the future =E2=80=93 it would go through a review b=
y the OTM team =E2=80=93 then be updated on the =E2=80=9CSource of Truth.=
=E2=80=9D&nbsp;&nbsp;</p></li>
</ul>
<ul local-id=3D"23d5e73b5209">
<li local-id=3D"dd8a838d1bde">
<p local-id=3D"4a3f7e76f75a">Any changes reviewed by the OTM would then kic=
k off:&nbsp;&nbsp;</p></li>
</ul>
<ul local-id=3D"1865111b436a">
<li local-id=3D"4f4713a3f7ff">
<p local-id=3D"fd214c43eca0">Change Management Process Review - (being defi=
ned and created now)&nbsp;&nbsp;</p></li>
</ul>
<ul local-id=3D"84cb845769b0">
<li local-id=3D"822542a93b87">
<p local-id=3D"ff56c3d02760">We will define set times change can take place=
 (1-2 times per year).&nbsp;</p></li>
</ul>
<ul local-id=3D"2533759468dd">
<li local-id=3D"ee4168339867">
<p local-id=3D"71dc52ff325e">This Project will be owned by the Innovation C=
enter, figuring out what tools will be affected, who all needs to be inform=
ed, ensuring change management is in the process before any changes take pl=
ace, documenting where changes cannot take place, etc.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p></li>
</ul>
<ul local-id=3D"f5618654edb4">
<li local-id=3D"aba17b8450b8">
<p local-id=3D"fd26c45639c7">Some tools might not be able to change example=
 D365 =E2=80=9Cbrand=E2=80=9D field. We could still make changes to the new=
er Product Family fields to map to the new naming conventions, but that wil=
l be worked out with multiple departments weighing in.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p></li>
</ul>
<ul local-id=3D"d8bfa4baf7b0">
<li local-id=3D"8303d1bff49b">
<p local-id=3D"91e2fc7af632">Others may take time, prioritized based on urg=
ency or need for finance reporting or active directory needs.&nbsp;&nbsp;</=
p></li>
</ul>
<ul local-id=3D"a1ae1436f110">
<li local-id=3D"21d19782a6b5">
<p local-id=3D"6fc6689894ff">Others need a good change management process (=
IT and HR are currently working on creating this now for ADP).&nbsp;&nbsp;<=
/p></li>
</ul>
<ul local-id=3D"f80f8c4bcea7">
<li local-id=3D"4d85f6d40991">
<p local-id=3D"fae0910268bd">The Innovation Center will be working with eac=
h department to flush out who will need to be notified on changes and what =
tools would be affected to manage if a change can or should take place ther=
e.&nbsp;&nbsp;</p></li>
</ul>
<p local-id=3D"d42a72b208e1"></p>
<p local-id=3D"74fe23054d3a"></p>
<p local-id=3D"9edd29d4f6de"></p>
<p local-id=3D"1f1dd84c4058"></p>
<p local-id=3D"c0adbba27640"></p>
<p local-id=3D"324cda484a16"></p>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
